#: crates/tisvlay-gui/ui/components/profiles_pane.slint:1475
msgctxt "ProfileDetail"
msgid ""
"What this PC does when the TV powers off by itself, or when the TV's remote "
"powers this PC off, whether the TV powering on wakes this PC, and whether "
"the remote's keys reach the desktop. TisVlay's own power-offs never count, "
"and neither event acts while a stream arms the TV. The TV's pane shows what "
"its connection supports."
